I will go and convince my people not to fight with Muhammadﷺ,

574
00:41:33,565 --> 00:41:37,342
and he was confident that he could do so because they loved him so much they wouldn't turn him down.

575
00:41:37,742 --> 00:41:40,566
But when he went to meet them, they started cursing him.

576
00:41:40,902 --> 00:41:44,340
So, he said some evil has befallen my people after I left.

577
00:41:44,979 --> 00:41:46,822
It's not evil, it's Islam that changed them.

578
00:41:47,924 --> 00:41:52,247
So, the second attempt to disunite the Ummah(امة) failed.

579
00:41:53,751 --> 00:41:55,113
We'll stop here In sha Allah ho Ta'ala(اِنْ شاء الله تعالى).

580
00:41:55,779 --> 00:41:59,957
صَلَّى الله عَلى سَيَّدِنَا محمد وَعَلى اَلِهِ وَ صَحْبِهِ وَسَلِّمْ تَسْلِيْمًا كَثِيْرًا

581
00:42:00,381 --> 00:42:02,001
وَالسلام عليكم ورحمة الله وبركاته

